Consequently, the model is not immediately suitable for generation, as the canvas size needs to be fixed during inference and cannot change over time (i.e., $|x_s| = |x|$). MLMs have been successfully applied in self-supervised representation learning settings, leading to strong results on downstream language tasks \citep{devlin-naacl-2019}.
